{"path":"types/is_implicit_lifetime","title":"std::is_implicit_lifetime","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>is_implicit_lifetime","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/is_implicit_lifetime","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"std::is_implicit_lifetime is a UnaryTypeTrait.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/type_traits\">&lt;type_traits&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> is_implicit_lifetime<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>std::is_implicit_lifetime</code> is a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnaryTypeTrait\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnaryTypeTrait</em></a>.\n</p><p>If <code>T</code> is an <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/ImplicitLifetimeType\">implicit-lifetime type</a>, provides the member constant <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>. For any other type, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">T</span></code> is an incomplete type other than an array type or (possibly cv-qualified) <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>If the program adds specializations for <code>std::is_implicit_lifetime</code> or <code>std::is_implicit_lifetime_v</code>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> T\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a type to check\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_variable_template\">Helper variable template</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_implicit_lifetime_v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> is_implicit_lifetime<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-inherited\">\n<h2 id=\"Inherited_from_std::integral_constant\">Inherited from <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"> <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>integral_constant</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Member_constants\">Member constants</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>value</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code>T</code> is an implicit-lifetime type, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member constant)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator bool</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   converts the object to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(C++14)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  Type\n</td>\n<td>  Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>value_type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span>, value<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_is_implicit_lifetime\"><code>__cpp_lib_is_implicit_lifetime</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/23#cpp_lib_is_implicit_lifetime_202302L\"><code>202302L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++23)</span></td>\n<td><code>std::is_implicit_lifetime</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co1\">// The following types are collectively called implicit-lifetime types:</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// * scalar types:</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//     * arithmetic types</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//     * enumeration types</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//     * pointer types</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//     * pointer-to-member types</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//     * std::nullptr_t</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// * implicit-lifetime class types</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//     * is an aggregate whose destructor is not user-provided</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//     * has at least one trivial eligible constructor and a trivial,</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//       non-deleted destructor</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// * array types</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// * cv-qualified versions of these types.</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;type_traits&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// arithmetic type is a scalar type</span>\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// cv-qualified a scalar type</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw2\">enum</span> E <span class=\"br0\">{</span> e <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>E<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// enumeration type is a scalar type</span>\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// pointer type is a scalar type</span>\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/nullptr_t\"><span class=\"kw109\">std::<span class=\"me2\">nullptr_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// scalar type</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> S <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x, y<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// S is an implicit-lifetime class: an aggregate without user-provided destructor</span>\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>S<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> S<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// pointer-to-member</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> X <span class=\"br0\">{</span> ~X<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// X is not implicit-lifetime class due to deleted destructor</span>\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>X<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// array type</span>\nstatic_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_implicit_lifetime_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">volatile</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// cv-qualified array type</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_scalar\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>is_scalar</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   checks if a type is a scalar type  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_array\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>is_array</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   checks if a type is an array type  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_aggregate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>is_aggregate</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   checks if a type is an aggregate type  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/start_lifetime_as\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>start_lifetime_as</span><span>start_lifetime_as_array</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implicitly creates objects in given storage with the object representation reused <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Template parameters","id":"Template_parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Helper variable template","id":"Helper_variable_template"},{"depth":2,"text":"Inherited from std::integral_constant","id":"Inherited_from_std::integral_constant"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member constants","id":"Member_constants"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"types","title":"Type support (basic types, RTTI)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::is_implicit_lifetime","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. std::is_implicit_lifetime is a UnaryTypeTrait."},{"label":"Template parameters","note":"T"},{"label":"Helper variable template"},{"label":"Inherited from std::integral_constant","children":[{"label":"Member constants"},{"label":"Member functions"},{"label":"Member types"},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++14","C++17","C++23"],"wordCount":366,"codeBlockCount":1}
